node_modules/
dist/
.astro/
.deploy-config.sh
.vercel/
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
package-lock.json

# Responsive image variants — regenerated by scripts/generate-responsive-heroes.mjs
# as part of `npm run build`. Keeps the repo small; Vercel regenerates on deploy.
public/heroes/responsive/
public/best-of/responsive/
public/team/responsive/

# Diagnostic probe files (safe to ignore)
.__*
__preflight_test
PROGRESS_PROBE.txt
scripts/queue/.__*

# Supervised review-only output. Never committed; uploaded as a CI artifact.
review-edition-*.md

# Daily working files for the manual publishing path. Both are regenerated
# every morning by `npm run brief:prep` and the editor pass. Committing them
# would put a full copy of other newsrooms' article text in this repository.
brief-workpacket.md
brief-drafts.json
brief-drafts.*.json

# Run record for the most recent Brief run. Deliberately NOT committed: a
# committed copy can never be accurate. At commit time the edition is composed
# and not yet live; by the time it is live, the commit has been made. The
# durable record that an edition shipped is the edition file plus the live site.
publication-status.json

# Feature drafting working files. article-review/ holds rendered review copies
# for the editor; the draft JSON carries its paragraph-to-source mapping and
# lives beside its research packet, which is gitignored for the same reason.
article-draft.json
article-draft-*.json
article-workpacket.md
article-review/
